    Patch-only sync for DM dashboard characters; lock realtime dep array
    
    FIX 1: Added useEffect([initialCharacters]) that merges incoming server props into
    existing characters state rather than replacing. Fresh server data wins for structural
    fields; dm_read from existing state is preserved if already set (covers the race where
    realtime wrote dm_read before the server refresh query completed). Prevents manual
    refresh / router.refresh() from wiping realtime-updated character fields.
    
    FIX 2: Realtime subscription dep array was already [selectedCampaign] — confirmed
    correct. Added explicit comment to lock it: 'campaignId only — do not add characters
    or other state here'. Realtime handler already used patch semantics ({ ...c, ...payload.new });
    added comment to make intent clear.
    
